---

---

<section
  id="contexto-nombramientos"
  class="py-14 md:py-16 bg-white dark:bg-[#0a0f1a] relative overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300"
>
  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.02] dark:opacity-[0.04]"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(0,255,178,0.3) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,255,178,0.3) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 60px 60px;"
  ></div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-16 max-w-7xl relative z-10">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <span class="inline-block py-1.5 px-3 bg-red-500/10 dark:bg-red-500/20 text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 font-sans font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-badge mb-4 border-l-4 border-red-500">
        Riesgo Operativo
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-sans text-section-title font-extrabold text-constival-navy dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        Lo que pasa cuando <span class="text-red-500 dark:text-red-400">no actualizas tus nombramientos.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="font-sans text-body text-constival-navy/60 dark:text-slate-400 mt-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Un nombramiento vencido o no inscrito puede paralizar las operaciones bancarias de tu empresa
        y generar incertidumbre legal ante cualquier acto jurídico.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-5">
      <div class="group relative bg-gray-50 dark:bg-constival-deep/50 p-6 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 hover:border-red-500/30 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-red-500 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-700"></div>
        <div class="text-red-500/10 font-sans font-black text-6xl absolute -right-1 -top-2 select-none pointer-events-none">!</div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 mb-4 text-red-500 dark:text-red-400">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 8.25h19.5M2.25 9h19.5m-16.5 5.25h6m-6 2.25h3m-3.75 3h15a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25V6.75A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 004.5 19.5z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-sans text-feature-title font-bold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-2">
            Cuentas bancarias <span class="text-red-500">congeladas</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-constival-navy/60 dark:text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed text-body">
            Un nombramiento vencido o no inscrito puede causar que el banco bloquee las cuentas corporativas.
            Sin firma autorizada vigente, no puedes mover fondos ni emitir cheques.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative bg-gray-50 dark:bg-constival-deep/50 p-6 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 hover:border-red-500/30 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-red-500 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-700"></div>
        <div class="text-red-500/10 font-sans font-black text-6xl absolute -right-1 -top-2 select-none pointer-events-none">!</div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 mb-4 text-red-500 dark:text-red-400">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m9-.75a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-9 3.75h.008v.008H12v-.008z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-sans text-feature-title font-bold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-2">
            Incertidumbre <span class="text-red-500">legal permanente</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-constival-navy/60 dark:text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed text-body">
            El administrador con cargo vencido sigue en funciones legalmente, pero cualquier acto puede ser
            cuestionado. Contratos, poderes y transacciones quedan en zona gris jurídica.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative bg-gray-50 dark:bg-constival-deep/50 p-6 border border-constival-navy/5 dark:border-white/5 hover:border-red-500/30 transition-all duration-500 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-0.5 w-0 bg-red-500 group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-700"></div>
        <div class="text-red-500/10 font-sans font-black text-6xl absolute -right-1 -top-2 select-none pointer-events-none">!</div>
        <div class="relative z-10">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 mb-4 text-red-500 dark:text-red-400">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M18.364 18.364A9 9 0 005.636 5.636m12.728 12.728A9 9 0 015.636 5.636m12.728 12.728L5.636 5.636"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-sans text-feature-title font-bold text-constival-navy dark:text-white mb-2">
            Operaciones <span class="text-red-500">paralizadas</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-constival-navy/60 dark:text-slate-400 font-sans leading-relaxed text-body">
            Sin representante legal inscrito no puedes firmar contratos, realizar trámites gubernamentales
            ni representar a la empresa ante terceros. Tu negocio queda detenido.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 text-center">
      <p class="font-serif italic text-body text-constival-teal dark:text-constival-mint/70 mb-5">
        "Un nombramiento no actualizado no es un detalle menor. Es una bomba de tiempo para tu operación bancaria."
      </p>
      <a
        href="#precio-nombramientos"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-sans font-bold text-body uppercase tracking-wider text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 bg-red-500/10 hover:bg-red-500/20 px-6 py-3 rounded-full transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
      >
        Actualizar mis nombramientos
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
